WEBVTT

00:04.290 --> 00:13.210
<b>HOLY GOD CALENDAR YEAR 434, UNDEAD CAPITAL OF NECROZOA</b>

00:24.420 --> 00:26.580
<b>Welcome home, Leonis.</b>

00:27.000 --> 00:28.830
<b>Ah, Roselia.</b>

00:31.080 --> 00:32.750
<b>Did you pay a visit to the battlefield?</b>

00:33.420 --> 00:37.420
<b>Yes. And fought a rather formidable foe. Even died twice.</b>

00:37.710 --> 00:41.750
<b>But naturally, I was victorious. I am the Undead King.</b>

00:43.750 --> 00:45.250
<b>Please accept this gift.</b>

00:46.580 --> 00:50.000
<b>These are the spoils we confiscated from their palace.</b>

00:51.210 --> 00:53.630
<b>Thanks, they look great.</b>

00:54.040 --> 00:56.630
<b>Do you mind holding on to them for me?</b>

00:56.630 --> 00:57.580
<b>Not at all.</b>

00:58.000 --> 01:00.330
<b>You've become quite the Demon Lord.</b>

01:00.540 --> 01:05.000
<b>I've developed an assortment of powerful spells, and I
made a new friend. A royal from the Shadow Kingdom.</b>

01:05.580 --> 01:09.460
<b>His name is Blackus Shadow Prince.</b>

01:09.710 --> 01:15.880
<b>He's become embroiled in a problematic feud, but I allow
his people to take shelter in my shadow when necessary.</b>

01:16.080 --> 01:18.630
<b>I learned the spell for such a thing from him.</b>

01:19.380 --> 01:23.540
<b>I, too, would like to give you a gift
in celebration of your victory.</b>

01:29.080 --> 01:30.420
<b>Why this…?</b>

01:31.290 --> 01:34.460
<b>Because it belonged to you during your time as a hero.</b>

01:34.960 --> 01:40.920
<b>But the Holy Sword doesn't suit you anymore…
The Demon Sword would be much more appropriate.</b>

01:44.210 --> 01:45.540
<b>The Demon Sword…</b>

01:45.960 --> 01:50.500
<b>However, the blade cannot be drawn
unless a certain condition has been met.</b>

01:50.920 --> 01:53.630
<b>It's a condition of which you're already aware.</b>

01:55.040 --> 01:58.330
<b>The sword will call your truth into question.</b>

03:35.880 --> 03:38.380
<b>THE DEMON LORD'S RESOLVE</b>

03:38.960 --> 03:42.580
<b>Le…o…nis…</b>

03:42.580 --> 03:47.710
<b>Arakael… Who would have guessed
we'd meet again a thousand years in the future?</b>

03:50.460 --> 03:56.380
<b>He's about to spawn more Voids… I guess he's the one
causing the "Stampede" or whatever Riselia called it…</b>

04:07.000 --> 04:08.130
<b>Miss Selia!</b>

04:10.210 --> 04:14.460
<b>The mark of control hasn't disappeared…
which means my minion is still alive.</b>

04:14.790 --> 04:17.130
<b>Arakael's goal must be to lure me out…</b>

04:17.830 --> 04:21.290
<b>Very well. I'll play your little game.</b>

04:21.290 --> 04:24.170
<b>But this time, I'm going to destroy you once and for all.</b>

04:26.880 --> 04:29.170
<b>Our mortal enemy has come back to life.</b>

04:29.830 --> 04:35.790
<b>Indeed. Though he's vastly different from what
he once was. He seems to have become a Void leader.</b>

04:36.210 --> 04:39.960
<b>A millennium passes and he demeans himself
by becoming an unrecognizable monster…</b>

04:40.920 --> 04:42.670
<b>Well, it's not all bad.</b>

04:43.000 --> 04:48.000
<b>The fact that Arakael has been resurrected means
that Roselia must be alive out there somewhere, too.</b>

04:49.960 --> 04:52.040
<b>What are those humans doing?</b>

04:54.380 --> 04:58.210
<b>A flimsy shack is better than nothing, surely.
Why expose themselves to danger?</b>

04:58.790 --> 05:01.710
<b>They're looking over here.
Do they have business with you?</b>

05:03.880 --> 05:05.670
<b>I'm used to being gawked at.</b>

05:06.000 --> 05:09.080
<b>Such devastating power strikes fear into people's hearts.</b>

05:09.460 --> 05:12.920
<b>That's how things were
even when I was human and a hero…</b>

05:13.250 --> 05:14.540
<b>Wait here for just a moment.</b>

05:14.540 --> 05:16.420
<b>But as a Demon Lord, it's advantageous.</b>

05:16.880 --> 05:18.670
<b>You'd be safer waiting inside.</b>

05:19.210 --> 05:20.420
<b>U-um…!</b>

05:21.710 --> 05:28.080
<b>Big Brother Leo… I just wanted t-to say…
thanks for protecting us.</b>

05:28.330 --> 05:30.000
<b>S-sure…</b>

05:30.170 --> 05:34.500
<b>We're alright now, so please…
go rescue Big Sister Selia!</b>

05:34.790 --> 05:35.830
<b>I'm begging you!</b>

05:36.040 --> 05:38.830
<b>Oh. I guess they aren't disgusted by me after all…</b>

05:39.580 --> 05:41.920
<b>Of course. You can count on me.</b>

05:45.670 --> 05:48.830
<b>I'll bring Miss Selia back in one piece. I promise.</b>

05:54.250 --> 05:56.880
<b>A Demon Lord does not go back on his word.</b>

05:57.380 --> 06:00.670
<b>Level 8 spell of containment: Zoah Doma!</b>

06:06.250 --> 06:09.290
<b>Rise now, my elite warriors of the damned!</b>

06:12.670 --> 06:14.580
<b>I've erected a barrier and stationed guards outside.</b>

06:15.000 --> 06:17.080
<b>So long as you stay in the building, you'll be safe.</b>

06:20.920 --> 06:23.750
<b>Even if they're attacked,
I'm not obligated to protect them.</b>

06:24.000 --> 06:29.080
<b>But ignoring a place near and dear to my minion's heart
would sully my name as a Demon Lord.</b>

06:31.420 --> 06:32.330
<b>What's in there?</b>

06:33.750 --> 06:35.750
<b>Something I procured near your residence, Lord Magnus.</b>

06:36.500 --> 06:38.920
<b>Blackus, you didn't steal these, did you?</b>

06:39.290 --> 06:45.380
<b>Shadow Kingdom royalty would never do such a thing.
A human gave it to me after I allowed her to pet my neck.</b>

06:45.960 --> 06:49.750
<b>I see… I'm hungry. May I have one?</b>

06:50.130 --> 06:51.040
<b>Have at it.</b>

06:53.880 --> 06:54.460
<b>What's wrong?</b>

06:53.880 --> 06:56.540
<b>Selia? Selia! Come in, Selia!</b>

06:57.080 --> 06:59.500
<b>Selia, can you hear me? Answer me, Selia!</b>

07:00.630 --> 07:03.130
<b>This is the 18th Platoon. Please respond!</b>

07:08.500 --> 07:09.920
<b>Raijin Deadly Slash!</b>

07:25.790 --> 07:27.500
<b>Just don't quit, do ya?!</b>

07:29.830 --> 07:33.040
<b>We've engaged a hydra-class Void
100 mertes west of our assigned district.</b>

07:33.500 --> 07:35.210
<b>Even with the adjacent platoons, we're underpowered.</b>

07:35.580 --> 07:37.040
<b>Get here fast, Selia!</b>

07:37.170 --> 07:39.250
<b>Miss Selia has been abducted by Voids.</b>

07:39.540 --> 07:40.630
<b>What'd you just say?!</b>

07:41.000 --> 07:42.290
<b>I'm going to get her back. Miss Elfiné,</b>

07:42.710 --> 07:46.500
<b>I need you to determine her location
using your Holy Sword's tracking abilities.</b>

07:46.670 --> 07:49.750
<b>It's too dangerous!
Let the platoon in charge of that district handle it!</b>

07:49.750 --> 07:50.880
<b>There's nobody here.</b>

07:51.040 --> 07:53.380
<b>They're probably busy right now… Give it a little longer-</b>

07:53.380 --> 07:54.500
<b>It'll be too late by then!</b>

07:58.130 --> 08:00.290
<b>Mode shift! Drag Blast!</b>

08:00.630 --> 08:01.830
<b>Regina! On your left!</b>

08:08.750 --> 08:10.920
<b>Are you able to see this area with your Holy Sword?</b>

08:14.960 --> 08:17.420
<b>No way… Did YOU do this?</b>

08:17.540 --> 08:19.960
<b>Yes. I'll explain everything later.</b>

08:19.960 --> 08:21.630
<b>Please just trust me on this!</b>

08:22.000 --> 08:26.000
<b>Alright. I'll try tracing the biosignature on file for Selia.</b>

08:33.040 --> 08:37.920
<b>Sublevel No. 5- No… Sublevel No. 7.
Near the heart of the Assault Garden…</b>

08:38.290 --> 08:40.000
<b>Picking up readings in the Power Plant Block!</b>

08:40.380 --> 08:41.460
<b>Thanks, Miss Elfiné.</b>

08:41.830 --> 08:43.000
<b>Elfiné, get outta there!</b>

08:53.830 --> 08:54.540
<b>What…?</b>

08:55.500 --> 08:56.170
<b>Huh?</b>

08:56.920 --> 08:57.960
<b>I swear…</b>

09:00.540 --> 09:02.830
<b>My master works his poor maid to the bone.</b>

09:03.460 --> 09:07.040
<b>Then again… I suppose it's easier
than working at the donut shop.</b>

09:14.130 --> 09:17.960
<b>The place with an enormous mana crystal
that they call a "power plant"? I'm familiar with it.</b>

09:18.380 --> 09:19.790
<b>Then take us straight there.</b>

09:20.330 --> 09:23.080
<b>And Shary? You ordered her to aid the humans?</b>

09:23.500 --> 09:28.500
<b>Yes. Her skills as a maid are lacking,
but she started out as an assassin who tried to kill me.</b>

09:28.960 --> 09:31.210
<b>She shouldn't have any trouble slaying monsters.</b>

09:31.540 --> 09:32.830
<b>I understand that much.</b>

09:33.330 --> 09:36.880
<b>What I want to know is why you sent her to babysit them</b>

09:37.040 --> 09:39.290
<b>when we're about to face off
against one of the Six Heroes.</b>

09:41.210 --> 09:46.540
<b>Elfiné's Holy Sword abilities are quite useful.
And besides, Regina is my minion's maid.</b>

09:47.500 --> 09:48.960
<b>Your answer makes no sense.</b>

09:49.580 --> 09:53.290
<b>I also cannot fathom your reason for casting
a defensive barrier around those children's hovel.</b>

09:55.630 --> 10:00.750
<b>Alright, fine! I've taken a slight liking
to the humans. That's all.</b>

10:01.670 --> 10:04.080
<b>Ah… How very like you, my friend.</b>

10:07.130 --> 10:08.580
<b>Al Gu Belzelga!</b>

10:26.000 --> 10:31.130
<b>Now then, it's high time you return my minion… Arakael!</b>

10:35.630 --> 10:39.250
<b>Surge forth, Infernal Flame,
and scorch them to naught but ash!</b>

10:40.170 --> 10:41.460
<b>Zof Amadia!</b>

10:55.040 --> 10:57.710
<b>Wow. Nice regenerative abilities.</b>

10:57.960 --> 11:04.710
<b>Leonis, you wretch…
I thought you perished a millennium ago…</b>

11:05.630 --> 11:09.630
<b>It appears you still possess
the intelligence required to speak.</b>

11:10.210 --> 11:13.630
<b>Unfortunately, you're a fool.
I did not perish. I simply sealed away my soul.</b>

11:13.920 --> 11:19.420
<b>YOU are the fool… The world has already changed…</b>

11:19.420 --> 11:21.380
<b>Oh yes, it's very different, isn't it?</b>

11:21.540 --> 11:23.380
<b>Especially the food. Much tastier.</b>

11:23.630 --> 11:29.710
<b>This world shall be rebuilt… along with the Empty Star…</b>

11:29.830 --> 11:32.290
<b>"Empty Star"? What's that supposed to mean?</b>

11:32.540 --> 11:39.380
<b>And I have been chosen…
to be the bringer… of glad tidings.</b>

11:55.880 --> 11:58.960
<b>You assimilated the priests from the Sacred Order…?!</b>

12:04.790 --> 12:06.880
<b>…elia! Can you… me?</b>

12:07.330 --> 12:08.170
<b>Leo…?!</b>

12:12.210 --> 12:14.790
<b>You came… to rescue me…</b>

12:16.830 --> 12:17.880
<b>Miss Selia…</b>

12:18.210 --> 12:19.000
<b>Watch out!</b>

12:19.460 --> 12:20.170
<b>Grr-!</b>

12:29.210 --> 12:30.630
<b>Sharianos!</b>

12:40.630 --> 12:42.080
<b>It seems we're out of our element.</b>

12:42.420 --> 12:45.170
<b>Your sorcery and mine
is becoming less potent by the second.</b>

12:45.580 --> 12:48.790
<b>You're right. This entire area is Arakael's domain.</b>

12:48.960 --> 12:50.830
<b>I suspect he's sapping us of our mana.</b>

12:51.670 --> 12:55.880
<b>Thou shalt sound the Hymn of Light…</b>

12:55.880 --> 12:59.630
<b>Thou shalt sound the Hymn of Light.</b>

13:00.380 --> 13:01.500
<b>Manifold chanting?!</b>

13:01.500 --> 13:06.960
<b>Level 8 holy sorcery… Lex Megido!</b>

13:14.000 --> 13:17.130
<b>O Darkness, I bid you burst apart… Arzam!</b>

13:18.170 --> 13:20.580
<b>Ras Gu Roa!</b>

13:21.960 --> 13:25.040
<b>Thou shalt sound the Hymn of Light.</b>

13:25.040 --> 13:27.250
<b>He's siphoning energy from the mana crystal…</b>

13:27.580 --> 13:29.000
<b>He has limitless firepower!</b>

13:29.630 --> 13:36.250
<b>Yes. What's more, he can chant several spells at once
with the priests he assimilated… The Great Sage, indeed.</b>

13:39.250 --> 13:40.880
<b>It'll be risky, but…</b>

13:41.290 --> 13:43.790
<b>Blackus, things are about to get crazy.</b>

13:44.210 --> 13:47.540
<b>Thou shalt sound the Hymn of Light.</b>

13:47.540 --> 13:50.540
<b>I have to… help him fight…</b>

13:51.080 --> 13:53.630
<b>If I can't fight now, then…</b>

13:55.460 --> 14:00.460
<b>…what was even the point…
of awakening my Holy Sword?!</b>

14:04.710 --> 14:06.170
<b>At this rate…</b>

14:06.750 --> 14:09.580
<b>…it'll be the same… as it was the last time!</b>

14:25.420 --> 14:26.580
<b>Gran Beld!</b>

14:31.040 --> 14:32.000
<b>Blackus!</b>

14:34.710 --> 14:36.170
<b>Howling Blaze!</b>

14:38.460 --> 14:40.540
<b>Lex Megido!</b>

14:46.290 --> 14:47.380
<b>Where is she…?</b>

14:50.790 --> 14:52.460
<b>I WON'T lose…</b>

14:52.460 --> 14:57.040
<b>Back then, I… I'm not the same as I was six years ago!</b>

15:09.630 --> 15:13.130
<b>I don't want to rely on someone else protecting me!</b>

15:15.380 --> 15:16.290
<b>Down there!</b>

15:22.540 --> 15:24.500
<b>I have to protect Leo…</b>

15:25.420 --> 15:28.040
<b>And I have to protect… the city!</b>

15:35.830 --> 15:38.130
<b>My apologies. I need time to recover.</b>

15:38.290 --> 15:40.460
<b>You were a great help. Rest well.</b>

15:40.540 --> 15:44.170
<b>You ingrate… What have you done?!</b>

15:44.750 --> 15:49.710
<b>Why, I merely supplied my minion
with a tiny bit of my mana-infused blood.</b>

15:51.630 --> 15:52.750
<b>Leo!</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:06.380
<b>Looks like you've gotten the hang
of your vampire powers.</b>

16:06.960 --> 16:07.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:07.790 --> 16:10.170
<b>This… is your blood, right?</b>

16:10.580 --> 16:12.420
<b>All you needed was a little push.</b>

16:13.130 --> 16:16.540
<b>Thanks. Because of you, I can join the fight.</b>

16:20.080 --> 16:27.130
<b>Leonis… I shall crush you…
using the most logical path…</b>

16:27.830 --> 16:35.170
<b>Thou shalt sound the Hymn of Light.</b>

16:35.170 --> 16:37.170
<b>Multiple simultaneous Level 10 spells…</b>

16:37.580 --> 16:41.040
<b>He intends to burn the entire city
to the ground, himself included!</b>

16:42.710 --> 16:44.420
<b>I'm going to get rid of him.</b>

16:44.830 --> 16:45.540
<b>Huh?</b>

16:45.540 --> 16:48.830
<b>But it may take some time. You'll keep me safe, right?</b>

16:50.080 --> 16:51.040
<b>Of course.</b>

16:54.960 --> 16:57.710
<b>I'll show 'em exactly what my Holy Sword can do!</b>

17:09.080 --> 17:10.040
<b>You're using it?</b>

17:10.420 --> 17:14.790
<b>Why not? I got my minion back.
No need to be discreet anymore.</b>

17:15.380 --> 17:18.500
<b>You realize what this means, yes?
The ramifications involved?</b>

17:19.000 --> 17:20.920
<b>Make certain it is more than just a passing fancy.</b>

17:24.210 --> 17:27.000
<b>The sword will call your truth into question.</b>

17:27.710 --> 17:31.250
<b>In other words, it has retained its will as the Holy Sword?</b>

17:31.630 --> 17:36.790
<b>Precisely. As a result of my blessing,
the Holy Sword has transformed into the Demon Sword.</b>

17:36.960 --> 17:39.210
<b>In it lies a staggering amount of power.</b>

17:39.460 --> 17:41.420
<b>And so it shall remain sealed tight.</b>

17:41.880 --> 17:47.210
<b>Sealed… So it's forbidden to draw the blade
unless a certain condition has been satisfied…</b>

17:56.880 --> 17:59.330
<b>The condition for drawing the Demon Sword. It's…</b>

18:00.040 --> 18:01.670
<b>…protecting my kingdom.</b>

18:04.130 --> 18:07.330
<b>Hear me. I wish to possess thy power for myself.</b>

18:08.000 --> 18:10.460
<b>Therefore… I claim this land as my own.</b>

18:10.460 --> 18:14.080
<b>The Seventh Assault Garden
shall henceforth belong to the Undead King!</b>

18:16.960 --> 18:22.630
<b>Thus, all who reside here shall become my subjects…
People I am duty bound to protect!</b>

18:26.580 --> 18:30.830
<b>Thou art the blade bestowed by the Heavens,
meant to save the world.</b>

18:30.830 --> 18:35.420
<b>Thou art the blade forged to rebel against the Heavens,
meant to destroy the world.</b>

18:35.420 --> 18:38.500
<b>A sacred blade, blessed by the gods.</b>

18:38.500 --> 18:41.130
<b>A wicked blade, blessed by a goddess.</b>

18:41.670 --> 18:44.000
<b>With thee at my side, I shall bring my enemies to ruin.</b>

18:44.380 --> 18:46.420
<b>And thy name, fallen to Darkness, is…</b>

18:47.000 --> 18:49.210
<b>…the Demon Sword, Dáinsleif!</b>

18:52.130 --> 18:53.040
<b>Leo…?</b>

18:53.920 --> 18:57.210
<b>The Demon Sword
acknowledged Lord Magnus' decision!</b>

18:57.830 --> 19:02.250
<b>Inconceivable! How did you get that sword…?</b>

19:03.790 --> 19:06.580
<b>Oh, so you can still feel fear, eh?</b>

19:06.580 --> 19:07.880
<b>Well, it's too late now!</b>

19:08.040 --> 19:12.960
<b>It is impossible to change…
the world's calamitous destiny!</b>

19:13.290 --> 19:16.250
<b>I'll conquer destiny with my own two hands!</b>

19:17.330 --> 19:20.170
<b>Rognas Kingdom School Secret Sword Technique:</b>

19:20.790 --> 19:22.420
<b>Ragna Lost!</b>

19:57.130 --> 20:01.540
<b>Emergence of new Voids has ceased.
Remaining forces are whittling down the rest.</b>

20:02.330 --> 20:03.630
<b>We survived…?!</b>

20:04.960 --> 20:07.000
<b>We managed to protect the city…?</b>

20:07.290 --> 20:10.670
<b>Disappearance of Void Lord
UK6402's biosignature, confirmed.</b>

20:11.210 --> 20:13.080
<b>The Stampede appears to be dying down.</b>

20:13.790 --> 20:15.790
<b>And what about the power plant?</b>

20:16.130 --> 20:20.000
<b>It looks like there was an explosive release of energy,
and it shut down immediately afterwards.</b>

20:20.630 --> 20:26.000
<b>So you're saying the Void Lord met its demise
when it got swept up in the power plant meltdown?</b>

20:28.380 --> 20:30.750
<b>That's certainly a stroke of luck…</b>

20:36.040 --> 20:41.420
<b>It was the combined efforts of every single person here.
That's why fortune smiled upon us.</b>

20:48.630 --> 20:49.830
<b>Leo!</b>

20:51.130 --> 20:53.000
<b>Glad you made it out, Leo.</b>

20:53.000 --> 20:54.830
<b>Lady Selia!</b>

20:54.830 --> 20:55.670
<b>Regina!</b>

20:55.670 --> 20:57.540
<b>Oh, thank goodness you're okay!</b>

20:58.040 --> 20:58.920
<b>Hey, guys!</b>

21:02.630 --> 21:05.420
<b>All members of the 18th Platoon, safe and accounted for!</b>

21:15.880 --> 21:17.580
<b>Ow-ow-ow…</b>

21:18.170 --> 21:22.080
<b>Curses… A Demon Lord stricken with sore muscles?</b>

21:23.080 --> 21:27.080
<b>Must be my punishment for using the sword skills
she locked away in the Demon Sword…</b>

21:28.080 --> 21:30.000
<b>This body can only handle so much…</b>

21:30.380 --> 21:32.830
<b>And to make matters worse,
I'm completely drained of mana…</b>

21:34.380 --> 21:35.790
<b>I bought you a sandwich!</b>

21:39.670 --> 21:40.630
<b>Also, here.</b>

21:41.380 --> 21:42.500
<b>What is it…?</b>

21:42.630 --> 21:46.630
<b>A medal, apparently.
The Sunny Spot House kiddos made it for you.</b>

21:47.960 --> 21:52.750
<b>I claimed mankind as the subjects of my kingdom.
My enemies from a thousand years ago…</b>

21:53.130 --> 21:57.290
<b>Still, I suppose it's my duty to protect anyone
who pays tribute to the Undead King.</b>

21:57.750 --> 21:59.790
<b>B-by the way, Leo…</b>

22:01.080 --> 22:06.080
<b>Y'see, um… It seems that wielding
my Holy Sword consumes a lot of blood…</b>

22:06.330 --> 22:07.960
<b>Well, I should think so.</b>

22:09.130 --> 22:12.250
<b>So, uh… I'd like some…</b>

22:12.460 --> 22:14.630
<b>What happened to having self-control?</b>

22:15.420 --> 22:17.250
<b>Jeez, you meanie…</b>

22:17.670 --> 22:20.040
<b>Alright, alright. But just a little bit.</b>

22:20.830 --> 22:21.960
<b>Thanks…</b>

22:27.880 --> 22:30.580
<b>Lady Selia! How's the kid holdin'-</b>

22:30.710 --> 22:32.880
<b>Wait, WHAAAAAT?!</b>

22:33.000 --> 22:34.750
<b>R-Regina?!</b>

22:35.000 --> 22:38.330
<b>L-Lady Selia! Wh-wh-what are you doing with him?!</b>

22:38.330 --> 22:39.960
<b>I-I was just, um…!</b>

22:40.210 --> 22:44.250
<b>We wanted to check up on him,
but it appears we chose a bad time to come barging in.</b>

22:45.330 --> 22:49.460
<b>Listen, Selia… Activities of that nature
are against the dorm rules.</b>

22:49.710 --> 22:53.670
<b>Y-you've got it all wrong! I swear!
I was treating his wounds, that's all!</b>

22:54.330 --> 22:55.710
<b>Please believe me!</b>

23:07.960 --> 23:10.830
<b>I was impressed by Your Highness'
swift decision to set sail</b>

23:10.830 --> 23:13.380
<b>when we first received news
of the Stampede. However…</b>

23:14.130 --> 23:17.290
<b>I didn't expect it to be contained at such an early stage.</b>

23:18.130 --> 23:19.170
<b>Shall we turn back?</b>

23:20.290 --> 23:26.080
<b>No. As royalty, I must show my appreciation to the
Holy Swordsmen who defended the Assault Garden.</b>

23:27.330 --> 23:28.420
<b>As you wish.</b>

23:46.580 --> 23:50.420
<b>THE PRINCESS' SECRET FEELINGS</b>
